* This is the BiomeMobWeight report file that is output every time the server starts.
* 
* Spawn Balance Utility (SBU) will use this file ONLY if it is renamed to BiomeMobWeight.csv.
* If you remove all lines for a Biome, the default values will be used
* So for an 'empty' biome, leave one line with a CREATURE or the AMBIENT line with bats.
* Lines starting with '*' are comments and ignored
* When this file is read, SBU writes summary information to the log file.
* 
